# Force LF line endings for shell scripts — CRLF breaks them on Linux/HA
# (e.g. "set: pipefail: invalid option name", "$'\r': command not found").
# This project's scripts run inside the HA Core container / HA OS host,
# both Linux — never Windows — so CRLF must never be introduced here,
# even if edited from a Windows machine.
*.sh text eol=lf
